[00:00.00] 作词 : Burt Bacharach
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Hal David
[00:09.69]Why do birds suddenly appear
[00:16.08]Every time you are near?
[00:22.02]Just like me, they long to be
[00:26.43]Close to you
[00:31.26]Why do stars fall down from the sky
[00:38.01]Every time you walk by?
[00:43.92]Just like me, they long to be
[00:54.99]Close to you
[00:55.23]On the day that you were born the angels got together
[00:59.70]And decided to create a dream come true
[01:04.77]So they sprinkled moon dust in your hair of gold
[01:08.76]And starlight in your eyes of blue
[01:16.11]That is why all the girls in town
[01:26.88]Follow you all around
[01:27.24]Just like me, they long to be
[02:00.09]Close to you
